    {
      "id": "section-random-skill-generation:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 Resistant to Hunger\n2 Strong Grip on Reality\n3 Slippery\n4 Stealth\n5 Strong\n6 Tough or Zombie Hunter\n(choose)\n",
