      "id": "section-random-skill-generation:p6",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Random Initial Skill Generation\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[103,399,431]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-skill-generation:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you prefer, instead of picking them, you can generate your character’s\nSkills randomly. Roll d6 for each Skill. On a 1-2, roll on table 1; on a 3-4,\nroll on table 2; and on a 5-6, roll on table 3. Then roll on the appropriate\ntable.\nEncumbrance Summary\nYou may carry 1 object in each hand or 1 two-handed weapon using 2\nhands; you may also carry:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[103,431,505],[103,505,583],[103,583,660],[103,660,667],[103,667,687],[103,687,754],[103,754,781]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-skill-generation:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● 10 objects;\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[103,781,795]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-skill-generation:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● 10 Food points; Extra Food count as 1 object each.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[103,795,848]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-skill-generation:p10",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Any number of  objects with negligible weight;\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[103,848,897]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-skill-generation:p11",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Add +3 items if you are Strong, or +5 if you are Strong (Expert);\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[103,897,965]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-skill-generation:p12",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Add +5 items if you have a backpack; if the backpack is stolen or\ndestroyed, you lose ALL objects carried, except those in your hands.\nName XP Sanity Life\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[103,965,1033],[103,1033,1102],[104,19,39]]"
    },
    {
